WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.510
The Commish would like to report a missing person.

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.670
Last seen posting memes twelve minutes ago.

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:07.150
Phone? Working.

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:08.890
Thumbs? Operational.

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:11.670
Saturday’s RSVP? Still missing.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.310
He can analyze a four-way all-in.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.270
But three RSVP buttons?

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.370
Apparently, a cold case.

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:20.150
Open the yellow chip.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:21.290
Choose your name.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:22.310
Tap In,

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:22.850
Maybe,

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:23.670
or Out.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.850
Help The Commish close the case.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:28.630
It’s TLPT RSVP.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:30.410
Come out of witness protection.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:31.830
It’s poker night.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:34.030
And the game’s afoot!
